				"integrated_multimodal_description:\nAt 0.00 seconds, <Picture 1> is fully referenced as the exact opening frame. At the end of the target video, <Picture 2> is fully referenced as the exact closing frame.\n\n[Shot 1] One continuous five-second cinematic martial-arts shot. Preserve the same adult female swordswoman, face, hairstyle, costume, sword and environment established by <Picture 1>. She launches into a fast but physically coherent sword combination, steps forward, turns once, completes a decisive diagonal slash, and settles naturally into the exact closing pose and composition from <Picture 2>. The camera performs one restrained lateral tracking move without cuts. Maintain realistic anatomy, stable hands, a solid sword shape, consistent clothing, natural motion blur and clear subject-background separation.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nFast footsteps, cloth movement, clean sword whooshes and one sharp metallic accent synchronized to the final slash. Stable ambient sound, no clipping, hiss or distortion.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A",
